    "body": "## Summary\n- apply the existing symmetric user-block policy before creating a saved-job bookmark\n- reject blocked relationships before bookmark lookup or persistence\n- keep the rejection neutral so reverse-block state remains private\n- add a regression test proving no saved-job lookup/insert occurs for blocked relationships\n- document the new enforcement boundary\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- no reverse-block state is exposed to the client\n- no location, route, live-tracking, payment, escrow or moderation data is added\n- existing bookmarks are not silently deleted; this change prevents creation of new associations across a block\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build and the repository's existing smoke workflows. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
